  partName: Gasket (6)
  description: The Gasket (6) is a tiny, thin-flat component made of Material.004,
    positioned at the middle-center-front of the engine, playing a crucial role in
    sealing and preventing fluid leaks. Its small size belies its importance, as
    it helps maintain engine performance and efficiency. Interestingly, the gasket's
    material composition allows it to withstand high temperatures and pressures.
